  "description": "Carrying forward the DNA of the Taïga EXP, this third generation is designed for riders who want to cover long distances across all types of terrain. Its versatile geometry promotes a comfortable and efficient riding position, whether for bikepacking, off-road ultra races, or all-terrain rides.\n\nBuilt from Reynolds 725 steel, the frame uses butted tubing to reduce weight while maximizing strength. Each frame size receives a size-specific tube selection, ensuring optimal performance while preserving the lively ride quality and comfort that steel is known for.\n\nThe Taïga EXP 3 is now offered with a steel or carbon fork, each designed with geometry adjusted to remain compatible with a 120 mm suspension setup.\n\nA durable and extremely versatile adventure bike, the Taïga EXP 3 is a true off-road travel platform, designed to go far and last long.\n\n*The frameset comes complete with wheel axles, installed headset, seatpost collar and frame protectors.",
